      "lineNbr": 211,
      "author": {
        "id": 1601154
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-07-13T19:41:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ack. However, I think Shan\u0027s point is that we never exactly specified what is the correct way to relay not available status in \"a test environment that is known to be good\".\n\nSo they point is that an OEM might just use the StatusCode to communicate that the property is not available instead of using the status in the VehiclePropValue.",
      "parentUuid": "107afab7_0630927a",
      "revId": "d515550cbaf868cdfe6f1ddc875a7a17f7150bdc",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
